        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur CARBELCOM, Carre Front Door Lock with Bellagio Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Carre Entryset with Bellagio Lever has a traditional design that is both beautiful and functional. This entryset comes boxed as a combo pack, including one passage set and a matching single cylinder deadbolt for one door. This Carre Front Door Lock with Bellagio Lever requires a minimum door thickness of 1-3/4 inches and is available for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A lever operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Carre Plate with Bellagio Lever and Deadbolt Combo Pack:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: 5-pin, C-keyway</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Carre Entrance Set with Bellagio Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Carre Plate Height: 4.75</li>\r\n<li>Carre Plate Width: 2.50\"</li>\r\n<li>Bellagio Lever Length: 4.72\"</li>\r\n<li>Bellagio Lever Projection: 1.9\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Height: 4.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Width: 2.50\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.125\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-CARBEL-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262386\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur CARBEL Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
